# db/ and uploaded_files/ are excluded because they live on the Fly volume.
# data/ IS included on purpose: it ships the two demo clients (Meridian
# Fabrics, Test Client) so the container can seed the empty volume on first
# boot (see the CMD in the Dockerfile). Without this the deployed app had no
# client/period folders at all and Reconcile's client picker was empty.
